	ethernet.ipv6.sctp.f1ap.F1AP-PDU.initiatingMessage.value.DLRRCMessageTransfer.protocolIEs.ProtocolIE-Field.value.RRCContainer.12  ).NR Radio Resource Control (RRC) protocol.DL-DCCH-Message.message.c1.rrcReconfiguration.criticalExtensions.rrcReconfiguration.measConfig.measGapConfig.gapUE.setup = *
